{"title":"Aurélie Journal — Forty-two pairs of hands","html":"\n\n\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/aurelie.css\" />\n<style>\n  /* ====== ARTICLE ====== */\n  .a-head {\n    padding: 170px 0 48px;\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .a-head .kicker {\n    font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n  }\n  .a-head h1 {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.2vw, 54px);\n    line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n    color: var(--navy);\n    margin: 18px 0 20px;\n  }\n  .a-head h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 400; }\n  .a-head .meta { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .a-head .meta b { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  .a-cover {\n    max-width: 1100px; margin: 40px auto 0;\n    aspect-ratio: 16/8; border-radius: var(--r-md); overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .a-cover img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }\n  .a-caption {\n    text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft);\n    margin-top: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  }\n\n  .a-body {\n    max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 64px 0 48px;\n  }\n  .a-body p {\n    font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.95;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    margin: 0 0 26px;\n  }\n  .a-body p b { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 600; }\n  .a-body p.lead::first-letter {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n    font-size: 3.4em; line-height: 0.85;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    float: left;\n    padding: 6px 12px 0 0;\n  }\n  .a-body h2 {\n    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.26em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    margin: 48px 0 16px;\n  }\n\n  .a-quote {\n    border: 0;\n    margin: 48px 0;\n    padding: 0 0 0 28px;\n    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);\n  }\n  .a-quote p {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif !important;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 23px !important;\n    line-height: 1.5 !important;\n    color: var(--navy) !important;\n    margin: 0 0 10px !important;\n  }\n  .a-quote cite {\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .a-inline-img { border-radius: var(--r-sm); overflow: hidden; margin: 40px 0; }\n  .a-inline-img img { width: 100%; display: block; }\n\n  /* Author + share */\n  .a-foot {\n    max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(162, 142, 102, 0.3);\n    padding: 36px 0 0;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .a-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }\n  .a-author .av {\n    width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 999px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-soft), var(--gold));\n    color: var(--navy);\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 21px;\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .a-author .who { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); }\n  .a-author .role { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); }\n  .a-share { display: flex; gap: 18px; }\n  .a-share a {\n    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--navy); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold); padding-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n  .a-share a:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n\n  /* Next reads */\n  .a-next { max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 88px 0 130px; }\n  .a-next .n-label {\n    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    display: block; margin-bottom: 28px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .a-next .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .a-next .row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n  .n-card { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }\n  .n-card .media { width: 120px; aspect-ratio: 4/3; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; flex-shrink: 0; }\n  .n-card .media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 1s var(--ease); }\n  .n-card:hover .media img { transform: scale(1.05); }\n  .n-card h3 {\n    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n    font-weight: 500; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3;\n    color: var(--navy); margin: 4px 0 6px;\n    transition: color var(--t) var(--ease);\n  }\n  .n-card:hover h3 { color: var(--gold); }\n  .n-card .kicker { font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); }\n  .n-card .meta { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  .a-back {\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .a-back:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n</style>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"site-nav\"></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== HEADER ==================== -->\n<header class=\"a-head\">\n  <a class=\"a-back\" href=\"journal.html\">← The Journal</a>\n  <div><span class=\"kicker\">Craftsmanship · N° 01</span></div>\n  <h1>Forty-two pairs of hands: the journey of <em>one earring.</em></h1>\n  <div class=\"meta\"><b>Anaïka Rao</b> · 8 July 2026 · 6 min read</div>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <figure class=\"a-cover\" style=\"margin-top: 40px;\">\n    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583292650898-7d22cd27ca6f?w=2000&h=1000&fit=crop&auto=format&q=85\" alt=\"Hands finishing a bracelet at the atelier bench\" />\n  </figure>\n  <div class=\"a-caption\">The finishing bench at Civil Lines — the last of twelve stations every piece passes through.</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ==================== BODY ==================== -->\n<article class=\"a-body\">\n  <p class=\"lead\">A Solène drop earring weighs a little over four grams. Held in the palm, it feels like almost nothing — a comma of gold, a single stone. But between the first sketch and the moment it leaves Civil Lines in its cotton pouch, it will have passed through forty-two pairs of hands over three weeks. We followed one pair, bench by bench, to write it down.</p>\n\n  <h2>Week one · Wax and fire</h2>\n  <p>Everything begins with <b>Ramesh-ji's carving bench</b>, where the design office's drawing becomes a wax model the size of a grain of rice. He works with dental tools and a jeweller's loupe, and he will reject a wax for a flaw no camera we brought could see. Two in three waxes don't survive him.</p>\n  <p>The approved wax is invested, burned out and cast at dawn — gold pours best, the casters insist, before the day warms up. What comes out of the flask looks nothing like jewellery: a dull, rough comma with a sprue still attached.</p>\n\n  <blockquote class=\"a-quote\">\n    <p>\"People think the stone is the jewellery. The stone is a guest. The metal is the house — and a house must be built properly.\"</p>\n    <cite>Vinod Sharma · Master Karigar</cite>\n  </blockquote>\n\n  <h2>Week two · The stone sits down</h2>\n  <p>Setting is the atelier's quietest room. Our 0.4 carat stone is checked against its SGL certificate, then handed to <b>Farida-apa</b>, who has set diamonds for twenty-two years. She cuts the seat, eases the stone in, and rubs four prongs over it in under an hour — then spends another two checking it under the loupe from every angle. A stone that moves, even a hair, goes back.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"a-inline-img\">\n    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605100804763-247f67b3557e?w=1400&h=900&fit=crop&auto=format&q=85\" alt=\"Diamond being inspected under the loupe\" />\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>Week three · Polish, hallmark, pouch</h2>\n  <p>Polishing happens in three passes — tripoli, rouge, and a final hand-buff with a muslin mop that has been \"broken in\" for months. Then the piece leaves us for a day: to the BIS centre, where it is assayed and comes back wearing its <b>hallmark and HUID</b> — six characters that will outlive everyone in this story.</p>\n  <p>The last pair of hands belongs to whoever made the piece longest. They write the commission card, sign it, and tie the pouch. For our earring, that was Farida-apa. The card reads, in Urdu and English: <b>\"Worn well, this will outlive us both.\"</b></p>\n</article>\n\n<!-- ==================== FOOT ==================== -->\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"a-foot\">\n    <div class=\"a-author\">\n      <span class=\"av\">A</span>\n      <span>\n        <span class=\"who\">Anaïka Rao</span><br />\n        <span class=\"role\">Founder &amp; Creative Director</span>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"a-share\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Share</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Instagram</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Copy link</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ==================== NEXT READS ==================== -->\n  <div class=\"a-next\">\n    <span class=\"n-label\">Read next</span>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <a class=\"n-card\" href=\"journal.html\">\n        <span class=\"media\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605100804763-247f67b3557e?w=400&h=300&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80\" alt=\"Solitaire ring\" /></span>\n        <span>\n          <span class=\"kicker\">Guides</span>\n          <h3>How to read a BIS hallmark — and why the HUID matters.</h3>\n          <span class=\"meta\">2 July 2026 · 4 min</span>\n        </span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"n-card\" href=\"journal.html\">\n        <span class=\"media\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576092762791-dd9e2220abd1?w=400&h=300&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80\" alt=\"Pearl choker\" /></span>\n        <span>\n          <span class=\"kicker\">People</span>\n          <h3>Master karigar Vinod on forty years at one bench.</h3>\n          <span class=\"meta\">8 May 2026 · 6 min</span>\n        </span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"site-footer\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n","scripts":[{"src":"assets/aurelie.js","type":""},{"src":"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js","type":""},{"src":"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js","type":""},{"src":"assets/aurelie-gsap.js","type":""}]}